            "review_title": "Review at Banh Canh Nga",
            "review_text": "drphucfhf\nDa Nang, Vietnam14 contributions\n0\nCheap but tasty street food\nMar 2018\nThis is a long-time well-known food shop for many generations of student at Phan Chu Trinh high school- Da Nang, as it locates right behind the school. Famous by rice -thick-noddle cooked in soup with shrimp,or crab, or pork-ribs, or fish ball- bring a popular tasty food. Price 25,000-50,000 vnd depend on choice. Option: casava-thick-noddle. Quite differen with “pho” or “bun”, it is “banh canh” in Vietnamese- worth a try.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 4, 2018",
